OL,3,GNEWSATraffic camera damaged beyond
OL,4,Arepair by air rifle
OL,5,
OL,6,FA traffic camera damaged by an air
OL,7,Frifle is likely to "cost taxpayers
OL,8,Fthousands of pounds," a council has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FThe Automatic Number Plate Recognition
OL,12,F(ANPR) camera, on Akers Way in Swindon,
OL,13,Fhad been put in place to record number
OL,14,Fplates and act as a deterrent to
OL,15,Fspeeders. It was located just yards
OL,16,Faway from where a teenager was fatally
OL,17,Fhit by a car in 2022.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
