OL,3,GNEWSATraffic camera damaged beyond
OL,4,Arepair by air rifle
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was among a number of cameras
OL,7,Freinstalled earlier in November,
OL,8,Fdespite a previous trial of the
OL,9,Ftechnology being halted when it was
OL,10,Ffound no camera data had been
OL,11,Fcollected.
OL,13,FNick Gardiner, the council's cabinet
OL,14,Fmember for highways and transport,
OL,15,Fdescribed the vandalism as "utterly
OL,16,Fstupid".
